    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506090/extras/20901556d0a52ad21a81f8d2b8747380.avif?t=1738691476\" data-has-big width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FlopShot</strong> is a <strong>multiplayer FPS</strong> designed for those who thrive on speed, <strong>chaos, and parkour</strong>. Dive into arenas with up to <strong>32 players</strong> and test your limits as you rack up kills. It\u2019s all about <strong>fast-paced action</strong>\u2014wall-running, sliding, and building momentum to outsmart and outrun your opponents.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506090/extras/5c799fe8bc435fa0080bcde2eee6a3c8.avif?t=1738691476\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVP (</strong>Player versus Player<strong>)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just another shooter. <strong>FlopShot</strong> blends <strong>competitive shooting</strong> with <strong>platforming</strong> in a way that feels fresh and exciting. The minimalist sci-fi aesthetic is sleek and clean, while dynamic lighting gives the arenas a cool vibe without going over the top. The focus? Pure gameplay. It\u2019s challenging enough to push your skills but easy for anyone to jump in and have fun.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506090/extras/3e9ac1d5adc672a3404345974cac0257.avif?t=1738691476\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506090/extras/20901556d0a52ad21a81f8d2b8747380.avif?t=1738691476\" data-has-big width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FlopShot</strong> is a <strong>multiplayer FPS</strong> designed for those who thrive on speed, <strong>chaos, and parkour</strong>. Dive into arenas with up to <strong>32 players</strong> and test your limits as you rack up kills. It\u2019s all about <strong>fast-paced action</strong>\u2014wall-running, sliding, and building momentum to outsmart and outrun your opponents.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506090/extras/5c799fe8bc435fa0080bcde2eee6a3c8.avif?t=1738691476\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVP (</strong>Player versus Player<strong>)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just another shooter. <strong>FlopShot</strong> blends <strong>competitive shooting</strong> with <strong>platforming</strong> in a way that feels fresh and exciting. The minimalist sci-fi aesthetic is sleek and clean, while dynamic lighting gives the arenas a cool vibe without going over the top. The focus? Pure gameplay. It\u2019s challenging enough to push your skills but easy for anyone to jump in and have fun.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506090/extras/3e9ac1d5adc672a3404345974cac0257.avif?t=1738691476\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "FlopShot throws you into chaotic battles with up to 32 players, where everyone\u2019s a ragdoll. Slide, wall-run, dodge, and outplay opponents in fast-paced, physics-based parkour FPS action. Despite the floppy chaos, movement stays tight and responsive, keeping the action nonstop. Ready to jump in?",
